{
  "name": "Web research agent with the QuanticData MCP server",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Web research agent (QuanticData MCP server)\nA chat agent that answers questions from the live web: the n8n AI Agent uses the hosted QuanticData MCP server (search, scrape and map tools) through the MCP Client Tool node and cites the pages it read.\n\n## Setup\n1. Credentials > New > **Header Auth**: name `QuanticData MCP`, header `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_KEY`. Select it in **QuanticData MCP**.\n2. Add your model credential to **Chat model** (any chat model node works in its place).\n3. Open the chat and ask a question.\n\nEach tool call the agent makes is billed like the matching API call: https://quanticdata.io/pricing/",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 5
      },
      "name": "About this workflow",
